Z||000029||p4n1c||06-10-2001||03:21 PM||||Saturday was indeed a good day, all the cars there were great to look at.  Becky and Pete, thanks for the rides in your Fiero's.  Very nice cars.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Hopefully I can make it for the next one, it was great meeting everyone.<P>I just back to Toronto went to get the parking slip for the car and locked my keys in it.  $45 later I have them back.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif"><P>------------------<BR>-=-=-=[ p4n1c ]=-=-=-<BR>1988 Olds Cutlass Supreme International<BR>2.8L MPFI V6/TH440-T4 OD auto<BR>"Ride the geriatric mobile.. err..  rocket"||||reg||14
